WEBVTT

00:08.800 --> 00:15.410
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.410 --> 00:18.750
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:22.050
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:22.050 --> 00:27.490
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.690 --> 00:34.630
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.630 --> 00:36.700
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:41.940
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.940 --> 00:44.970
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.970 --> 00:48.210
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.850
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.850 --> 00:55.480
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:08.060
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.060 --> 01:13.340
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.340 --> 01:16.440
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.440 --> 01:19.670
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.670 --> 01:23.250
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.250 --> 01:25.870
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:50.710 --> 01:55.070
<b>Fools, don't they realize it's useless already?</b>

01:56.310 --> 01:59.440
<b>Really, they certainly don't tire of it.</b>

02:02.280 --> 02:05.150
<b>Isn't it perfect for target practice though?</b>

02:07.520 --> 02:10.390
<b>It definitely is an ideal situation
to relieve some stress.</b>

02:11.060 --> 02:14.150
<b>Especially since you don't seem to
have used that much recently.</b>

02:29.340 --> 02:31.440
<b>Looks like I haven't lost my touch.</b>

02:32.250 --> 02:33.710
<b>I'm happy for you.</b>

02:35.280 --> 02:37.880
<b>Then let's finish this up quickly.</b>

02:49.000 --> 02:50.430
<b>And eat!</b>

03:25.830 --> 03:27.300
<b>I...</b>

03:31.010 --> 03:34.740
<b>I was regarded with contempt
as a heretical existence...</b>

03:36.340 --> 03:38.440
<b>...and designated as a filthy being.</b>

03:39.280 --> 03:40.710
<b>And then...</b>

03:44.090 --> 03:46.020
<b>The one I loved was taken from me.</b>

03:50.590 --> 03:53.930
<b>I rebelled against the Heavens,
but what have I gained?</b>

03:57.830 --> 03:59.360
<b>What do I seek?</b>

04:03.710 --> 04:05.140
<b>A new Heaven and Earth?</b>

04:07.710 --> 04:09.180
<b>Or...</b>

04:35.970 --> 04:37.440
<b>It's time, isn't it?</b>

04:41.740 --> 04:43.210
<b>So, it's beginning.</b>

04:44.880 --> 04:46.510
<b>Zenon, Shien...</b>

04:46.510 --> 04:50.250
<b>Whoops, no saying any
unnecessary things now.</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.090
<b>There should only be one
thing you need say.</b>

04:55.860 --> 04:56.830
<b>Zenon...</b>

04:56.830 --> 04:58.030
<b>Yo!</b>

04:58.030 --> 04:59.330
<b>Shien...</b>

04:59.330 --> 05:00.960
<b>Yes!</b>

05:00.960 --> 05:03.190
<b>The time has come. Let's go!</b>

05:15.940 --> 05:17.410
<b>All right!</b>

05:19.180 --> 05:23.080
<b>Hey, now, is this for real? He did
most of them all by himself.</b>

05:24.050 --> 05:27.150
<b>All those demons in just five minutes...</b>

05:28.090 --> 05:30.960
<b>We seem to be getting pushed
more into the background.</b>

05:31.890 --> 05:35.120
<b>Maybe we'll totally fade out of the
picture for real someday.</b>

05:37.900 --> 05:39.600
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

05:39.600 --> 05:41.070
<b>Sanzo?</b>

05:42.100 --> 05:43.700
<b>No, nothing.</b>

05:44.640 --> 05:47.070
<b>Come on, everyone, let's go eat!</b>

05:54.920 --> 05:57.390
<b>Food! Food! What do you wanna eat?</b>

05:57.390 --> 06:00.620
<b>Xiaolongbao or spring rolls? Or babaocai?</b>

06:00.620 --> 06:02.190
<b>Or Tianjin bowl?</b>

06:02.190 --> 06:04.890
<b>Hey, those are all Chinese.</b>

06:04.890 --> 06:07.300
<b>What? They are?</b>

06:07.300 --> 06:08.700
<b>Look here...</b>

06:08.700 --> 06:13.300
<b>What does it matter?
We'll be eating regardless.</b>

06:13.300 --> 06:14.870
<b>Moron.</b>

06:14.870 --> 06:16.770
<b>No paper fan today?</b>

06:18.840 --> 06:20.740
<b>I can't even get worked up enough for it.</b>

06:21.740 --> 06:27.080
<b>Sanzo, you'll ruin your complexion
if you're always so tense.</b>

06:27.080 --> 06:29.140
<b>You should take some time like these two.</b>

06:32.650 --> 06:35.380
<b>Loosen up? I don't think we can.</b>

06:44.430 --> 06:45.900
<b>Bastards.</b>

06:47.100 --> 06:51.700
<b>You sure? If we fight here, the town
will take some damage too.</b>

06:52.810 --> 06:56.440
<b>Well, not that we really care.</b>

06:56.440 --> 06:59.440
<b>What a coincidence. I don't really care either.</b>

07:00.620 --> 07:02.170
<b>What do you want today?</b>

07:02.780 --> 07:06.120
<b>It doesn't seem as if you just
happened to come here.</b>

07:07.090 --> 07:09.920
<b>I came to give you a final warning.</b>

07:09.920 --> 07:14.330
<b>Hand over the Maten Scripture, or else.</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:15.930
<b>Or else, what?</b>

07:15.930 --> 07:17.520
<b>We'll take it by force.</b>

07:18.500 --> 07:21.730
<b>I'll have you know, we won't be
pulling punches anymore.</b>

07:23.070 --> 07:26.110
<b>So, you've finally decided to get serious?</b>

07:26.110 --> 07:27.780
<b>Let's hurry up and get to it!</b>

07:27.780 --> 07:30.840
<b>I'll pay you back for everything
you've done so far!</b>

07:33.050 --> 07:34.740
<b>I'll wait until tomorrow morning.</b>

07:35.920 --> 07:38.610
<b>Hey, now... This again?</b>

07:39.920 --> 07:42.080
<b>Decide on your answer by then.</b>

07:43.560 --> 07:45.390
<b>Quit trying to impress us!</b>

07:45.390 --> 07:47.260
<b>You already know the answer!</b>

07:50.400 --> 07:53.970
<b>I told you before. Don't rush.</b>

07:53.970 --> 07:57.370
<b>I've wanted to say something
to you for a while.</b>

07:57.370 --> 07:58.970
<b>What is it?</b>

07:58.970 --> 08:02.840
<b>Your slow-going personality makes me puke!</b>

08:04.250 --> 08:06.010
<b>Have you forgotten, Konzen?</b>

08:06.780 --> 08:08.720
<b>That life back in the Heavens?</b>

08:09.580 --> 08:11.050
<b>What the hell are you talking about?</b>

08:13.890 --> 08:16.910
<b>Gods are generally a patient bunch.</b>

08:17.530 --> 08:19.760
<b>Besides, it makes you want to stretch it out</b>

08:19.760 --> 08:21.250
<b>when you're having an exciting time.</b>

08:22.400 --> 08:27.660
<b>Listen closely. We'll be waiting on that
hill early tomorrow morning.</b>

08:29.800 --> 08:31.270
<b>We might not come, you know.</b>

08:32.340 --> 08:36.540
<b>We're really bad when it
comes to appointments.</b>

08:36.540 --> 08:38.670
<b>Will you run?</b>

08:40.220 --> 08:44.590
<b>Nothing, I only tried saying it,
just as you did.</b>

08:44.590 --> 08:45.920
<b>The hell?!</b>

08:45.920 --> 08:49.820
<b>Oh, dear, we can't even
oversleep at this rate.</b>

08:51.260 --> 08:56.000
<b>Just don't sleep, then you don't have to
worry about oversleeping.</b>

08:56.000 --> 08:59.430
<b>Ooh, what a nice suggestion.</b>

08:59.430 --> 09:00.940
<b>Write it down now.</b>

09:00.940 --> 09:05.200
<b>Whoops, I guess you won't need to,
since you'll be dead tomorrow.</b>

09:07.680 --> 09:09.470
<b>Well, enjoy yourselves if you can</b>

09:10.080 --> 09:12.510
<b>since this may end up being your last night.</b>

09:14.050 --> 09:15.520
<b>I'll be looking forward to it.</b>

09:25.290 --> 09:27.300
<b>I don't like this.</b>

09:27.300 --> 09:30.530
<b>What? Why not? It's yummy!</b>

09:30.530 --> 09:33.840
<b>You just shut up and eat!</b>

09:33.840 --> 09:35.430
<b>Sheesh, what gives?</b>

09:36.140 --> 09:39.570
<b>But they certainly are a rare kind.</b>

09:39.570 --> 09:43.640
<b>They came all this way to see us,
just to give us a warning.</b>

09:45.010 --> 09:47.780
<b>Either they're really confident</b>

09:47.780 --> 09:50.320
<b>or really not taking us seriously</b>

09:50.320 --> 09:51.790
<b>or really bored...</b>

09:53.290 --> 09:55.090
<b>It's likely all of the above.</b>

09:56.360 --> 09:59.420
<b>Man, what are we? Toys?</b>

10:00.860 --> 10:03.670
<b>What they want is the Maten Scripture.</b>

10:03.670 --> 10:07.160
<b>Knowing that gives us a means of
working out countermeasures.</b>

10:08.700 --> 10:10.170
<b>Countermeasures?</b>

10:13.410 --> 10:15.980
<b>I don't care if they're gods or what!</b>

10:15.980 --> 10:18.670
<b>We eliminate anyone who gets in our way!</b>

10:19.680 --> 10:21.150
<b>That's all there is to it!</b>

10:22.580 --> 10:24.640
<b>Hey, Sanzo, what's wrong?!</b>

10:25.520 --> 10:26.990
<b>Come on, Sanzo!</b>

10:30.660 --> 10:33.260
<b>What are you so mad about, Sanzo?!</b>

10:33.260 --> 10:34.730
<b>Shut up, you noisy pest!</b>

10:35.430 --> 10:39.130
<b>Sheesh, you always do that
when you're in a bad mood.</b>

10:39.130 --> 10:40.700
<b>What did you say?!</b>

10:40.700 --> 10:43.140
<b>Never mind that, Sanzo. Buy me a meat bun!</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:46.940
<b>We just ate!</b>

10:46.940 --> 10:51.740
<b>I can't help it, I'm hungry! Come on, Sanzo!</b>

10:55.080 --> 10:56.550
<b>You stupid monkey.</b>

11:00.190 --> 11:02.520
<b>Yay! Meat bun! Meat bun!</b>

11:06.490 --> 11:07.930
<b>Hey, Hakkai.</b>

11:08.600 --> 11:09.900
<b>Yes?</b>

11:09.900 --> 11:11.660
<b>Nah, it's nothing.</b>

11:12.670 --> 11:16.540
<b>Please say it. I'll keep wondering,
and I won't be able to sleep.</b>

11:18.970 --> 11:20.840
<b>Are we really going to be able to swing it?</b>

11:21.640 --> 11:23.240
<b>Who knows?</b>

11:23.240 --> 11:27.870
<b>But I'd hate to be outmatched like last time.</b>

11:32.850 --> 11:34.410
<b>Guess we've got no choice but to do it.</b>

11:56.580 --> 11:57.350
<b>Bastards...</b>

11:57.350 --> 11:58.810
<b>Please wait, Gojyo.</b>

11:59.550 --> 12:03.710
<b>It seems they've come here
for the same reason as us.</b>

12:04.790 --> 12:06.890
<b>Gimme the strongest you've got.</b>

12:06.890 --> 12:08.360
<b>Oolong tea.</b>

12:08.990 --> 12:10.860
<b>And the same thing for those two over there.</b>

12:12.360 --> 12:14.800
<b>Hey, Hakkai, we're going somewhere else!</b>

12:14.800 --> 12:16.260
<b>They'll ruin the taste of wine!</b>

12:16.930 --> 12:21.540
<b>Don't be such a rebel. The fight's
tomorrow morning, remember?</b>

12:21.540 --> 12:24.270
<b>I wouldn't mind if we did it right now.</b>

12:24.270 --> 12:26.270
<b>How boorish of you.</b>

12:26.270 --> 12:27.210
<b>What?!</b>

12:27.210 --> 12:30.900
<b>Long ago, there was someone who
supposedly often spoke thus...</b>

12:35.050 --> 12:38.750
<b>Flowers are great. Women are great too.</b>

12:40.960 --> 12:47.660
<b>And with some good wine,
what more could you want?</b>

12:59.470 --> 13:02.110
<b>I can't appreciate the taste of wine,</b>

13:02.110 --> 13:05.240
<b>but I can understand what
that person was saying.</b>

13:06.810 --> 13:08.340
<b>Well, excuse me for being boorish.</b>

13:09.180 --> 13:13.990
<b>So, are you going to introduce boorish
me to a woman or something,</b>

13:13.990 --> 13:15.460
<b>oh great god?</b>

13:16.090 --> 13:21.080
<b>I can't introduce you to a woman,
but there are flowers right there.</b>

13:22.000 --> 13:24.160
<b>How awfully playful of you.</b>

13:24.930 --> 13:27.770
<b>Or what? Are you treating us so you can...</b>

13:27.770 --> 13:29.700
<b>What does it matter?</b>

13:29.700 --> 13:32.170
<b>This will all be settled tomorrow anyway.</b>

13:33.370 --> 13:35.210
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

13:35.210 --> 13:37.610
<b>Well, you about summed it up.</b>

13:38.610 --> 13:40.110
<b>I'll have you know...</b>

13:40.110 --> 13:42.280
<b>I ain't expecting anything.</b>

13:42.280 --> 13:43.770
<b>Oh, really.</b>

14:05.470 --> 14:07.770
<b>It's no good. I can't sleep at all.</b>

14:20.020 --> 14:21.760
<b>So, it's tomorrow?</b>

14:21.760 --> 14:23.220
<b>Tomorrow, I'll get him for sure.</b>

14:24.660 --> 14:26.130
<b>Can't sleep?</b>

14:30.770 --> 14:32.200
<b>Sanzo?</b>

14:33.070 --> 14:34.560
<b>Hey, Sanzo.</b>

14:36.400 --> 14:38.070
<b>You think it'll be clear tomorrow?</b>

14:39.270 --> 14:41.410
<b>That settles it. You're a stupid monkey.</b>

14:41.410 --> 14:43.910
<b>Why?! I was just...</b>

14:43.910 --> 14:45.380
<b>Just what?</b>

14:46.080 --> 14:47.550
<b>I can't wait.</b>

14:48.080 --> 14:51.710
<b>When I think about him,
I get all excited and...</b>

14:53.850 --> 14:56.290
<b>You're not a brat on the day
before a field trip, you know.</b>

15:00.560 --> 15:02.160
<b>I'm going to do it.</b>

15:02.160 --> 15:04.320
<b>Just watch, I'll beat him up for sure!</b>

15:06.130 --> 15:07.760
<b>Never mind, just go to sleep.</b>

15:14.780 --> 15:17.110
<b>With all the stars you can see tonight,</b>

15:17.110 --> 15:18.770
<b>there's probably no worry of rain tomorrow.</b>

15:23.680 --> 15:26.180
<b>Homura, just you wait!</b>

15:50.310 --> 15:51.780
<b>It's time.</b>

15:53.050 --> 15:54.640
<b>Let's hear your answer.</b>

15:56.820 --> 15:58.840
<b>Go to Hell, you piece of scum!</b>

16:02.160 --> 16:03.890
<b>So, that's your answer?</b>

16:04.560 --> 16:06.460
<b>You know what to do, Goku?</b>

16:06.460 --> 16:09.900
<b>What they want is Sanzo's Scripture.</b>

16:09.900 --> 16:14.170
<b>I know that! All we gotta do is get
them before they get us, right?</b>

16:14.170 --> 16:17.240
<b>In short, yes.</b>

16:17.240 --> 16:20.370
<b>This is what always ends
up happening, you know?</b>

16:20.370 --> 16:23.240
<b>What will happen will happen?</b>

16:23.240 --> 16:25.800
<b>You done with your strategic meeting?</b>

16:26.850 --> 16:29.610
<b>Then shall we get started?</b>

16:32.990 --> 16:34.450
<b>Let the battle begin.</b>

16:47.130 --> 16:49.900
<b>I haven't forgotten what happened that time.</b>

16:50.540 --> 16:52.010
<b>Stronger...</b>

16:53.440 --> 16:56.040
<b>Grow even stronger, Son Goku.</b>

16:58.210 --> 16:59.680
<b>Well, take a look</b>

17:00.850 --> 17:02.320
<b>and see if I've become stronger!</b>

17:03.920 --> 17:06.110
<b>I HAVE gotten stronger!</b>

17:07.120 --> 17:08.760
<b>Goku!</b>

17:08.760 --> 17:10.220
<b>Homura!</b>

17:13.560 --> 17:14.800
<b>We're coming too!</b>

17:14.800 --> 17:16.260
<b>Please prepare yourselves.</b>

17:17.330 --> 17:18.800
<b>Eat this!</b>

17:21.670 --> 17:23.860
<b>We have ways to protect against
that too, you know.</b>

17:24.640 --> 17:26.110
<b>In that case...</b>

17:28.180 --> 17:31.870
<b>Don't think it will be one-sided
forever, you morons!</b>

17:33.110 --> 17:37.150
<b>Speed, power, the edge on his techniques...</b>

17:37.150 --> 17:39.680
<b>He's truly like a different person than before.</b>

17:40.960 --> 17:43.660
<b>Son Goku, with this...</b>

17:43.660 --> 17:46.290
<b>Homura, where are you looking?!</b>

17:50.030 --> 17:51.970
<b>What?!</b>

17:51.970 --> 17:54.330
<b>I have you now!</b>

17:57.040 --> 18:02.740
<b>Whoops, can't let you touch
our leader so easily.</b>

18:06.910 --> 18:08.380
<b>What?!</b>

18:10.620 --> 18:12.280
<b>Homura!</b>

18:15.560 --> 18:16.090
<b>Goku!</b>

18:16.090 --> 18:17.830
<b>Homura!</b>

18:17.830 --> 18:19.290
<b>I got a hit in.</b>

18:25.970 --> 18:29.030
<b>You pass the test, Son Goku.</b>

18:41.750 --> 18:43.250
<b>Not so fast!</b>

18:43.250 --> 18:45.650
<b>That's my line.</b>

18:45.650 --> 18:47.720
<b>I can at least slow him down!</b>

18:47.720 --> 18:49.190
<b>I won't allow it.</b>

18:51.360 --> 18:52.830
<b>Konzen!</b>

18:54.530 --> 18:56.190
<b>I've had enough of this!</b>

19:04.140 --> 19:05.610
<b>Damn!</b>

19:08.640 --> 19:10.080
<b>Sanzo!</b>

19:13.180 --> 19:14.650
<b>Still not active?</b>

19:15.950 --> 19:17.890
<b>Enough crap...</b>

19:17.890 --> 19:19.350
<b>In that case...</b>

19:30.500 --> 19:32.160
<b>I've been waiting for this!</b>

19:43.340 --> 19:45.540
<b>I'll be borrowing this for a while, Konzen.</b>

19:46.580 --> 19:50.570
<b>Hey, General Kenren, pass this
message on to Goku for me.</b>

19:51.350 --> 19:54.190
<b>If he wants to get the Maten Scripture back,</b>

19:54.190 --> 19:56.520
<b>tell him to come to the Tower of Konran.</b>

19:56.520 --> 19:57.990
<b>What?!</b>

19:59.190 --> 20:00.660
<b>I'll be waiting.</b>

20:02.260 --> 20:03.730
<b>Homura!</b>

20:05.600 --> 20:07.090
<b>Bastard...</b>

20:07.770 --> 20:09.500
<b>Homura!</b>

20:18.150 --> 20:19.840
<b>You son of a...</b>

20:21.220 --> 20:22.680
<b>Sanzo!</b>

20:25.150 --> 20:28.350
<b>That's why I like you, Konzen.</b>

20:29.660 --> 20:31.650
<b>Zenon, Shien, let's go.</b>

20:34.600 --> 20:35.960
<b>Sanzo!</b>

20:36.100 --> 20:37.890
<b>Sanzo!</b>

20:38.030 --> 20:39.500
<b>Sanzo!</b>

20:49.780 --> 20:58.620
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:59.950 --> 21:10.390
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou
no naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:11.730 --> 21:21.870
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:23.180 --> 21:36.190
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:36.190 --> 21:47.600
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:47.600 --> 21:58.910
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:58.910 --> 22:11.090
<b>Ima nara kitto aruite yukeru doko made mo</b>
